{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salmon Man is a <strong>physics VR platformer</strong> where you climb upstream using nothing but your paddle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist\u00a0</strong>now and <strong>join our Discord!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1f An epic journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the top through a world full of wonder, physics based obstacles, and absurdity. But don\u2019t expect it to go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/c5c96b3b98e6e1e62b17ab2f920fcd14.poster.avif?t=1767802219\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/c5c96b3b98e6e1e62b17ab2f920fcd14.webm?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/c5c96b3b98e6e1e62b17ab2f920fcd14.mp4?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Built for speedrunning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your paddle is both your lifeline and your biggest enemy. One wrong move can make you lose all your progress, but skilled players can compete for the fastest times on the global speedrun leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6be3b4557acad791cd42c840b840cb07.poster.avif?t=1767802219\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6be3b4557acad791cd42c840b840cb07.webm?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6be3b4557acad791cd42c840b840cb07.mp4?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcaa A true test of will</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new paddles, complete achievements and side challenges, and push your limits as you master the physics-based movement. Salmon Man is made for players who love difficult games and the satisfaction of earning every victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6ea7c48ee10e8ebce8e3af749dbf1790.poster.avif?t=1767802219\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6ea7c48ee10e8ebce8e3af749dbf1790.webm?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6ea7c48ee10e8ebce8e3af749dbf1790.mp4?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2654710?t=1767802219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/a7f81cf48228fef3b00f784bbf48a3c107b8d9bb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767802219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/cc6be59d063b6f26c2f4ef3bde02360fa149ba50/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767802219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/cc6be59d063b6f26c2f4ef3bde02360fa149ba50/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767802219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4091240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salmon Man is a <strong>physics VR platformer</strong> where you climb upstream using nothing but your paddle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist\u00a0</strong>now and <strong>join our Discord!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1f An epic journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the top through a world full of wonder, physics based obstacles, and absurdity. But don\u2019t expect it to go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/c5c96b3b98e6e1e62b17ab2f920fcd14.poster.avif?t=1767802219\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/c5c96b3b98e6e1e62b17ab2f920fcd14.webm?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/c5c96b3b98e6e1e62b17ab2f920fcd14.mp4?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Built for speedrunning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your paddle is both your lifeline and your biggest enemy. One wrong move can make you lose all your progress, but skilled players can compete for the fastest times on the global speedrun leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6be3b4557acad791cd42c840b840cb07.poster.avif?t=1767802219\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6be3b4557acad791cd42c840b840cb07.webm?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6be3b4557acad791cd42c840b840cb07.mp4?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcaa A true test of will</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new paddles, complete achievements and side challenges, and push your limits as you master the physics-based movement. Salmon Man is made for players who love difficult games and the satisfaction of earning every victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6ea7c48ee10e8ebce8e3af749dbf1790.poster.avif?t=1767802219\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6ea7c48ee10e8ebce8e3af749dbf1790.webm?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/6ea7c48ee10e8ebce8e3af749dbf1790.mp4?t=1767802219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Valem Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/30e55dc1ec9d5b7327fc4d64877dbd0851a0e8ed/header.jpg?t=1767802219","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2654710/420360256/7c4e0d403d649237f4a9be15583e6d6a046bc3f4/1760710207/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762360366","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2654710/420360256/7c4e0d403d649237f4a9be15583e6d6a046bc3f4/1760710207/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762360366","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2654710/420360256/7c4e0d403d649237f4a9be15583e6d6a046bc3f4/1760710207/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762360366","id":257219240,"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.aka